# #188: Jaina wavedashes (air dodge down and forward on the first airborne
# frame) right then left. a keeps the shield held through the landing so it
# rises on the first frame after landing lag (8.24 a frame, above walk speed);
# b lets go of everything. The shield slide brakes by double traction like b's
# landing slide and stops on the same frame; shield rise and drop frames are
# those of main.
#! chat -dev quick hero jaina proudmoore
60 a tap B 1
60 b tap B 1
64 a stick 1 -1
64 a shield 1
64 b stick 1 -1
64 b shield 1
65 a stick 0 0
65 b stick 0 0
65 b shield 0
115 a shield 0
130 a tap B 1
130 b tap B 1
134 a stick -1 -1
134 a shield 1
134 b stick -1 -1
134 b shield 1
135 a stick 0 0
135 b stick 0 0
135 b shield 0
185 a shield 0
